        "original_id": "a09cc946-c602-51df-bc29-3cd41f568cfc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Liaoyang, Changchun, Liaoning province, T'ai-tzu River, Anshan, China\n- People: Yuan Baojing\n- Topics: Population, metropolitan areas\n\nFacts:\n- In 2010, Liaoyang in east-central Liaoning province, China, formed a metropolitan area with Anshan that had 2,057,200 inhabitants.\n- In 2010, Changchun had a total population of 7,674,439 under its jurisdiction according to the China census.\n- Yuan Baojing was born on 16 February 1966.\n- Yuan Baojing was a Chinese billionaire from Liaoyang, Liaoning province.\n- Yuan Baojing died on 17 March 2006.",
